00:23:26.280 --> 00:23:27.030
<v Criminal>Yeah.

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:28.560
<v Benton Harbor>Do you feel anything strange?

00:23:28.560 --> 00:23:29.430
<v Criminal>Uh--

00:23:29.430 --> 00:23:31.160
<v Benton Harbor>Anything at all?

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:31.990
<v Criminal>Uh, yeah.

00:23:31.990 --> 00:23:33.370
<v Benton Harbor>And what is that?

00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:35.900
<v Criminal>I'd like to kiss you.

00:23:35.900 --> 00:23:36.750
<v Benton Harbor>Kiss me?

00:23:36.750 --> 00:23:37.500
<v Criminal>Yeah.

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:38.780
<v Benton Harbor>How do you account for that?

00:23:38.780 --> 00:23:46.680
<v Criminal>Because you look like an adorable bunny rabbit.

00:23:46.680 --> 00:23:48.820
<v Woman>Well, how did it go?

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:50.170
<v Benton Harbor>What else do you have?

00:23:50.170 --> 00:23:52.280
<v Woman>A Teddy bear and a chicken.

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:53.440
<v Benton Harbor>A Teddy bear?

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:54.590
<v Woman>It'd be cute.

00:23:54.590 --> 00:23:56.680
