00:38:36.340 --> 00:38:37.740
<v Miss Helfinger>The chicken missile.

00:38:37.740 --> 00:38:39.920
<v Police Commissioner>Oh, yes, of course. The--

00:38:39.920 --> 00:38:42.420
<v Miss Helfinger>And it's ready for test sequence number one.

