<v Miss Helfinger>Number one.

00:38:44.310 --> 00:38:48.030
<v Police Commissioner>Well, that's very nice, very nice, yes.

00:38:48.030 --> 00:38:49.310
<v Miss Helfinger>Hello, winged warrior.

00:38:49.310 --> 00:38:50.280
<v Benton Harbor>Right here, Miss Helfinger.

00:38:50.280 --> 00:38:52.400
<v Miss Helfinger>The commissioner said that's very nice.

00:38:52.400 --> 00:38:56.590
<v Benton Harbor>Oh, fine. In that case, Miss Helfinger, have the commissioner stand by with the chicken missile receiver.

00:38:56.590 --> 00:38:56.740
